Free fixes:
  - YouTube returned 17 videos but only 3 transcripts captured. The most common remaining cause is a stale yt-dlp binary - YouTube's caption format changes frequently and old binaries silently fail every transcript. Update via your package manager: scoop update yt-dlp (Windows), brew upgrade yt-dlp (macOS), or pip install -U yt-dlp.

